{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜で握手会でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近握手会は地方か幕張ばっかで横浜あんまりなかった気がするからすごい久しぶりな感じした（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/02/07/3632441/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェラピケ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このデザインはバレンタインデーまでの限定なんだって❤\n速攻買っちゃった^_^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみよく家で寝るときはスウェット派でしょ？って言われたりイメージでそう思われる事多いんだけど\n実際はジェラピケとか女子女子した感じです。\n意外でしょ？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/02/07/3632441/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キルフェボンのケーキ食べたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部では真っ黒でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/02/07/3632441/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OUTRO SOL"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は割といろんな格好するけど全身黒が多い。\n買い物とかしてても黒い服ばっかり目がいってしまう(＞＜)\nだから最近はなるべく色物を買うように心がけてはいる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/02/07/3632441/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の話題は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ホリケンさん舞台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ヴァンガード"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4月頑張れ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・モバメ多いイイネ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・オススメの映画は？←「湯を沸かすほどの熱い愛」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・バスラ当たった！or外れた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・能條牧場の入り方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざっくり思い出すとこんな感じだった気が。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに4月はヴァンガードの本番とホリケンさん舞台の本番とで2回ほど関東の個別握手会欠席になります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぅう.........m(._.)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり握手会は大切だから2回も出られないのはちょっと寂しいしなんだか忘れられてしまいそうで（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まああみのファンの方達に限ってそんな事はきっとないと思うし\nそのぶん舞台両方とも全力で頑張るし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援しててね(＞＜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/02/07/3632441/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんかずちゃんあみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ そうだっ\n前回のブログの問題の答え！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は、一実の家でした❤\n大半が一実って答えてたね、さすが^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また泊まり行くから待っててねぇ〜ずーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月10日発売のヤングギター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと乃木團が表紙やらせていただきました❤\n嬉しい...\n超世界的音楽雑誌に乃木團が表紙なんて（；＿；）\nありがたいすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さま是非チェックしてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.握手会のときお花を送ってくださったあみあみ族